### Real claim
POST http://localhost:5000/api/claims
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "claimText": "cholera outbreak reported in Turkana county",
  "category": "health",
  "location": "Turkana"
}

### Claim with no matches
POST http://localhost:5000/api/claims
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "claimText": "purple rain fell across machakos yesterday",
  "category": "weather",
  "location": "Machakos"
}

### Impossible claim
POST http://localhost:5000/api/claims
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "claimText": "flying pigs were spotted in Nairobi yesterday",
  "category": "news",
  "location": "Nairobi"
}

### Verdict Test
POST http://localhost:5000/api/claims
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "claimText": "maize prices have doubled in Machakos market this week",
  "category": "food_security",
  "location": "Machakos"
}

### Preview a bulletin
POST http://localhost:5000/api/bulletins/preview
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "original_text": "A cholera risk alert has been issued for Turkana County following contaminated water reports. Residents are advised to boil drinking water and seek treatment immediately if symptoms occur.",
  "ward": "Turkana Central",
  "language": "sw"
}

### Send it (use the bulletin_id returned above)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/bulletins/12/send
Content-Type: application/json